Architecture: all
Maintainer: ernest-it <161004105+ernest-it@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45), gir1.2-soup-3.0
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ernest-it/MacBar
Description: macOS-style menu bar and dock for GNOME (Ubuntu)
 MacBar is a GNOME Shell extension: a menu bar with a system menu, the
 active app's name, a Now Playing island, weather, sound with output and
 microphone switching and OpenRGB lighting, plus a magnifying dock and
 window Workspaces. It turns Ubuntu Dock off while it is on.
